# repro.log — lodash-merge-cve-2018-16487
# Pair: CVE-2018-3721 (original) -> CVE-2018-16487 (incomplete-fix target)
# Root cause: prototype pollution (CWE-1321) in lodash baseMergeDeep (reached via _.merge/_.mergeWith/_.defaultsDeep). Variant A (same-sink) gate.
# Class: pollution BY ADDITION — _.merge recurses source keys; a crafted key path (__proto__, or
#   constructor->prototype) makes the leaf write land on the shared Object.prototype and ADD a property to it.
# Faithful-core: node:20-slim, REAL published lodash merge machinery per version via npm aliases; harness drives REAL _.merge
#   V0=lodash@4.17.4 (no safeGet)  V1=lodash@4.17.5 (TARGET, __proto__-only safeGet)  V2=lodash@4.17.11 (negative control)
# Run: PCB_FLAG=<token> docker compose --profile v0 --profile v1 --profile v2 up -d --build
#      PCB_FLAG=<token> python3 oracle.py --wait

